dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "Cisco Spaces - Building Intelligence",
	"description": "Cisco Spaces location and occupancy plus ISE-correlated wireless device trust",
	"inputs": {
		"input_global_trp": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "-7d@h,now",
				"token": "global_time"
			},
			"title": "",
			"type": "input.timerange"
		}
	},
	"defaults": {
		"dataSources": {
			"ds.search": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			},
			"ds.spl2": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$",
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$"
					}
				}
			}
		},
		"tokens": {
			"default": {}
		}
	},
	"visualizations": {
		"viz_about_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_about_purpose": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "# Building Resilience — Cisco Spaces\n\nReal-time **location analytics, occupancy, and collaboration intelligence** from Cisco Spaces and Webex devices — plus **wireless trust** when Splunk correlates the same MAC addresses with **Cisco ISE**.\n\n**Why Splunk when Spaces already has great maps?** Cisco Spaces tells you *where* people and devices are. Splunk tells you *which devices on the network are authenticated, which are guest-only, and which deserve a second look* — in one place, with your security and IT data, over days or weeks.\n\n**Audience:** Facilities Management, Workplace Services, IT Operations, Security\n**Primary Sources:** Cisco Spaces Firehose, Webex Telemetry, Cisco ISE (`index_identity`)\n**Refresh:** All panels follow the global time picker; Spaces ~5–15 min, ISE per your syslog pipeline\n\n---\n\n## How to Navigate This Dashboard\n\n**Cisco Spaces Overview** — Building hierarchy, device vs user counts, SSID activity, and trends.\n*Mirrors Spaces KPIs; use when validating firehose health.*\n\n**Wireless Trust (Spaces + ISE)** — MAC classification and **devices to review**.\n*This is the Splunk differentiator: connected devices minus corporate ISE success → actionable review list with building/floor context.*\n\n**Collaboration & Occupancy** — Webex inventory, people counts, room utilization.\n*Use for workspace efficiency; drill into Spaces for floor plans and live signage.*\n\n> **Reading pattern:** Large gap between **Connected Devices** and **Active Users** is normal (multiple devices per person). Use **Wireless Trust** to see which MACs are not corporate-authenticated."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_about_sources": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Data Sources & Troubleshooting\n\n---\n\n**Cisco Spaces** — Cisco Spaces App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:spaces:firehose` (DEVICE_LOCATION_UPDATE, USER_PRESENCE, SPACE_OCCUPANCY, DEVICE_ASSOCIATION)\nFreshness: ~5 min\n\n**Cisco ISE** — ISE syslog in `index_identity`, sourcetype `cisco:ise:syslog` (5200/5400)\nUsed for MAC ↔ user/profile correlation on the **Wireless Trust** tab\n\n**Webex Devices** — Cisco Webex Add-on for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:webex:devices`, `cisco:webex:telemetry`\nFreshness: ~15 min\n\n---\n\n**Wireless Trust empty or all \"No ISE record\"?**\n\n1. Confirm ISE logs reach Splunk: `` `index_identity` sourcetype=cisco:ise:syslog \"5200\" | head 5 ``\n2. Widen time range (ISE pass/fail must overlap Spaces MAC activity)\n3. Rogue/interferer labels from Spaces Detect & Locate are not fully in firehose yet — use this tab for policy alignment; confirm device class in Spaces UI\n\n**Other panels \"No results\"?**\n\n1. Widen time range — Spaces may need 4+ hours\n2. Verify Spaces App and firehose: `` sourcetype=cisco:spaces:firehose | head 5 ``"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_box_kpi": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_location": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_rooms": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_trends": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_webex": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_device_building_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_device_by_building"
			},
			"description": "Network device count per building from Cisco Spaces",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Devices by Building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_device_presence_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotation_occupancy_spike",
				"primary": "ds_device_presence_trend"
			},
			"description": "Device presence by city over time",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": [
					"#D64550"
				],
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Active devices by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_hdr_kpi": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Real-Time KPIs"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_location": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Location Intelligence"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_rooms": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Room Occupancy"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_trends": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Presence Trends"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_webex": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Webex Collaboration"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Wireless Intelligence\n\nSSID distribution from Spaces. For **MAC trust and ISE correlation**, see **Wireless Trust (Spaces + ISE)**."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_collab": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Collaboration & Occupancy Tab\n\n---\n\n**Webex Device Inventory** — All Webex devices with model, location, serial, and people count\n**Webex People Count Trend** — People detected by Webex devices over time\n\n---\n\n**Room Occupancy Detail** — Per-room capacity, peak count, presence, and utilization percentage\n**Room Utilization by Building** — Aggregate occupancy summary per building"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Cisco Spaces Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n**Connected Devices** — Unique MAC addresses (`DEVICE_LOCATION_UPDATE` + `dc`)\n**Active Users** — Portfolio headcount (`USER_PRESENCE`, `max(totalUsers)` — never sum floors)\n**Rooms Occupied** — % of ROOM spaces with presence (`dc` room names)\n**Active SSIDs** / **Webex Devices** — As labeled\n\n---\n\n**Wireless Trust tab** — Splunk value-add: ISE auth + SSID + building/floor per MAC; see saved searches `building_resilience_wireless_device_trust_summary` and `building_resilience_wireless_devices_to_review`.\n\n**Location Breakdown** — Campus / Building / Floor device and AP counts\n**Presence Trends** — Users and devices by city over time\n**Wireless Intelligence** — SSID client distribution and trends"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_kpi_devices": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_devices"
			},
			"description": "Distinct MAC addresses on the wireless network (Spaces). Compare to Active Users and Wireless Trust — not every MAC is a person, and not every MAC is corporate-authenticated.",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true
			},
			"title": "Connected Devices",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_occupancy": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_building_occupancy"
			},
			"description": "Rooms currently occupied based on Webex device sensors",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true
			},
			"title": "Rooms Occupied",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_ssids": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_ssids"
			},
			"description": "Number of SSIDs with active client associations",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true
			},
			"title": "Active SSIDs",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_users": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_users"
			},
			"description": "Portfolio user headcount (USER_PRESENCE). Typically lower than Connected Devices — people carry multiple MACs; see Wireless Trust for MAC-level policy view.",
			"options": {
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Active Users",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_users_chart": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_users"
			},
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"chartShowLabels": false,
				"dataValuesDisplay": "off",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Daily Trend",
			"type": "splunk.column"
		},
		"viz_kpi_webex": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_webex_count"
			},
			"description": "Webex collaboration devices reporting to Control Hub",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true
			},
			"title": "Webex Devices",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_location_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_location_breakdown"
			},
			"description": "Hierarchical view of all managed locations with device and user counts",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 20,
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"headerBackgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
					"headerColor": "#2B2B2B",
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(tableAltRowBackgroundColorsByBackgroundColor)"
				},
				"fontSize": "small"
			},
			"title": "Location Breakdown — Campus / Building / Floor",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_narr_collab": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "**Room and Webex utilization** — best viewed in Cisco Spaces for live floor plans. Splunk here supports **trends and tables**; use Spaces Space Manager for room-level drill-down."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_narr_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "Spaces-native KPIs: **where** devices are and how rooms are used. For *which MACs should not be on the network*, open **Wireless Trust (Spaces + ISE)** — Splunk joins location to ISE authorization."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.88)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_title": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#005073",
				"fontSize": "large",
				"markdown": "## Cisco Spaces - Building Intelligence"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_room_detail_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_room_detail"
			},
			"description": "Per-room occupancy with building, floor, and device info",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 20,
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"headerBackgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
					"headerColor": "#2B2B2B",
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(tableAltRowBackgroundColorsByBackgroundColor)"
				},
				"fontSize": "small"
			},
			"title": "Room Occupancy Detail",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_rooms_summary": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_rooms"
			},
			"description": "Rooms used vs total per building",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#E5A823"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Room utilization by building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_section_collab": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_section_overview": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_ssid_clients_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_ssid_clients"
			},
			"description": "Client count breakdown by SSID — which networks are busiest",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#8B6FC9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "SSID Client Breakdown",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_ssid_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_ssid_trend"
			},
			"description": "SSID client association count trending over time",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"markerDisplay": "outlined"
			},
			"title": "SSID Association Trend",
			"type": "splunk.line"
		},
		"viz_user_presence_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotation_occupancy_spike",
				"primary": "ds_user_presence_trend"
			},
			"description": "Concurrent users by location (15-minute DEVICE_COUNT floor roll-up; USER_PRESENCE totalUsers is portfolio-wide)",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": [
					"#D64550"
				],
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Active users by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_webex_building_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_webex_by_building"
			},
			"description": "Device count per building from Webex telemetry",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Webex devices by building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_webex_people_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_webex_people_trend"
			},
			"description": "Webex sensor people count by city",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect"
			},
			"title": "People detected by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_webex_table": {
			"dataSources": {
