				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Wireless Trust Tab\n\n---\n\n**Devices to Review** — Count of MACs not corporate-authenticated (ISE pass on non-guest SSID)\n**Trust segments** — Breakdown: corporate auth, guest, guest WLAN only, Spaces-identified, no ISE identity, other\n**Review table** — MAC, building, floor, SSID, ISE user/profile, why flagged\n\n---\n\n**Story for leadership:** *Cisco Spaces tells you where devices are; Splunk tells you which devices on the network are trusted.* Confirm interferer/rogue types in Spaces Detect & Locate until firehose exports those categories."
